---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { SITE } from '../lib/site'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — The Reel Vault"
  description="Get in touch with The Reel Vault — suggestions, corrections, rights enquiries and takedown requests."
>
  <div class="section-head">
    <div><span class="kicker">Say hello</span><h2>Contact</h2></div>
  </div>

  <article class="prose" style="margin-top:18px">
    <p>
      We are a small, curation-led project and we genuinely like hearing from the people who
      use the Vault. Whether you have spotted an error, want to suggest a film, or need to
      raise a rights or takedown matter, the best way to reach us is by email:
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:1.3rem;margin:18px 0">
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>
    </p>

    <h3>What to include</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Suggestions &amp; corrections</strong> — a link to the title and a line on what you noticed.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Rights &amp; takedown requests</strong> — please include the details listed in
        our <a href="/terms">Terms of Use</a> so we can act quickly.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Press or partnership</strong> — tell us a little about what you have in mind.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      We read everything and aim to reply within a few days. Thank you for helping us keep the
      projector running.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
